WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.415
Some decisions can be made using ordinary project

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.135
conventions.

00:00:03.576 --> 00:00:06.525
Others change what the product does or what access it

00:00:06.571 --> 00:00:07.094
needs.

00:00:07.535 --> 00:00:10.205
The owner should decide whether the first release imports

00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:13.816
an inbox, sends messages, or handles real customer

00:00:13.862 --> 00:00:14.536
information.

00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:18.135
The agent can recommend a safe default and do independent

00:00:18.181 --> 00:00:19.667
work while the answer is pending.

00:00:20.271 --> 00:00:23.812
Ask only the question that changes the design: "Should the

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.622
first version include email import, or should it track

00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:28.224
form submissions only?"
